# Input for testroms/rtc with the host's clock at 366 days after 2000-01-01 00:00:00 (31622400
# seconds) on every frame, so the clock chip starts on 2001-01-01 and the ROM's first check, which
# expects 2000-01-01, fails: band 1 turns red. It proves a replay uses the recorded wall time
# rather than the host's clock. Hand-written; the final frame matches tests/golden/rtc.txt
# (frames=4).
ninge-input 1 rom=6f3b save=none:cbf29ce484222325
f=1 wall=31622400
f=2 wall=31622400
f=3 wall=31622400
f=4 wall=31622400
